-- SCENARIO EXPANSION: DELIVERY SHIPMENTS (IN-TRANSIT, FAILED ATTEMPT, RETURNED, DELIVERED)

-- SCENARIO EXPANSION: HR LEAVE REQUESTS (ALL APPROVAL STATES)

-- SCENARIO EXPANSION: ITSM TICKETS (BREACHED SLA, REMINDED, UNASSIGNED URGENT, RESOLVED)

-- SCENARIO EXPANSION: WORKFLOW CONTRACTS (EXPIRING SOON, RENEWED, EXPIRED) & APPROVALS

