-- SCENARIO EXPANSION: AUDIT CORRELATED EVENTS

-- SCENARIO EXPANSION: CMS REVIEWS & FAQS

-- SCENARIO EXPANSION: NON-HR PORTAL USERS (EXTERNAL / CONTRACTORS / CONSULTANTS WITHOUT HR EMPLOYEE RECORD)

